                                "sense_id": "6536a0b7-bd12-35d5-b049-aba4a10db822",
                                "text": "So she lifted her head and continued the trek. “See, that's more like it,” Norman said. “Walk like you own this motherfuckin' town. You are looking snatched in that dress.” Norman pretended as though he had yanked something up out of thin air."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa40eff4-e877-44ac-a672-25d75c2ace76",
                                "sense_id": "6536a0b7-bd12-35d5-b049-aba4a10db822",
                                "text": "“Everyone says that you should wait, because your body doesn’t fully come in until you’re like 30, and I’m 20 years old, and why am I going to wait until I’m 30 to be snatched?” Catera Northup, an exotic dancer from Rhode Island, said."
                            }
                        ]
