                                "sense_id": "fbcf2aa6-2972-3115-9066-ae747d20c65c",
                                "text": "However, one could make a strong correlation to her success ruling Europe in the 1600s to her having a snatched waist while strutting around the castle in heels. Come on, you know the world bends to a woman with 36-24-36 body measurements."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d2c63cfe-4c37-41f1-81f7-be8c5e4bf389",
                                "sense_id": "fbcf2aa6-2972-3115-9066-ae747d20c65c",
                                "text": "“You know I'm endorsing a new line?” “I can tell with your extra snatched waist.” I gave her the stink eye. “Don't hate, bitch.” We both started cracking up."
